            <p class="vx-kicker">// idea 2 · a pipeline with seams</p>
            <h2>Core plans. Plugins decide where.</h2>
            <p class="sub">
              Core reads the configs, builds the task graph, derives each key and picks the order.
              Where a task runs, where its outputs are stored and who hears about the run are stages a
              plugin fills. Core applies no plugin by default. Running on this machine and caching on
              its disk are the floor under every plugin, so a workspace with no plugins still runs and
              caches, and a plugin that declines a task hands it back.
            </p>
